OL,3,GNEWSAIs a whale fossil the leftovers of
OL,4,Aa Bronze Age Sunday roast?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of a whale, believed to date
OL,7,Fback to the Bronze Age, has been
OL,8,Fdiscovered buried on a beach in
OL,9,FIslandmagee.
OL,11,FA 10-year-old boy was out looking for
OL,12,Ffossils along the shore when he spotted
OL,13,Fthe back of the skull protruding from a
OL,14,Fbank of earth - but could the fossil be
OL,15,Fthe remnants of a prehistoric Sunday
OL,16,Froast?
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
